      "importance": 70,
      "importanceReasonZh": "PP-OCRv6 是百度飞桨的 OCR 模型，支持 50 种语言，参数范围广，具有实际应用价值，且发布在 Hugging Face 上，易于获取。",
      "importanceReasonEn": "PP-OCRv6 is Baidu PaddlePaddle's OCR model, supporting 50 languages with a wide parameter range, practical value, and easy access via Hugging Face.",
      "scoringMode": "ai",
      "titleZh": "PP-OCRv6 登陆 Hugging Face：支持 50 种语言，参数规模从 150 万到 3450 万",
      "titleEn": "PP-OCRv6 on Hugging Face: 50-Language OCR from 1.5M to 34.5M Parameters",
      "summaryZh": "百度飞桨团队在 Hugging Face 上发布了 PP-OCRv6 系列模型，支持 50 种语言，提供从 1.5M 到 34.5M 参数的多个版本，适用于移动端到云端等不同场景。",
      "summaryEn": "Baidu PaddlePaddle team released the PP-OCRv6 model series on Hugging Face, supporting 50 languages with multiple versions ranging from 1.5M to 34.5M parameters, suitable for scenarios from mobile to cloud.",
      "keywords": [
        "PP-OCRv6",
        "OCR",
        "Hugging Face",
        "多语言",
        "参数"
      ],
      "topics": [
        "OCR",
