      "scoringMode": "ai",
      "titleZh": "推动下一波AI浪潮：在佩科斯新建数据中心以扩展容量",
      "titleEn": "Powering the next wave of AI: Expanding capacity with our new datacenter in Pecos",
      "summaryZh": "微软今日宣布其历史上最大规模的数据中心容量扩充之一。将在德克萨斯州佩科斯新建一个数据中心园区，将全球数据中心容量增加约2吉瓦（GW），以满足各行业和地区对AI和云服务强劲且持续的需求。除了技术之外，这还……该文章首发于微软官方博客。",
      "summaryEn": "Today, Microsoft is announcing one of the largest single capacity additions in our history. In Pecos, Texas, we will build a new datacenter campus, expanding our global datacenter capacity by approximately 2 gigawatts (GW) to meet strong and sustained customer demand for AI and cloud services across industries and regions. Beyond the technology, this is... The post appeared first on The Official Microsoft Blog.",
      "keywords": [
